Chapter: ScreenRecorderOffTest
  cites Dev chapter ScreenRecorder
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 A recording started with the default 3 second countdown, ticked into
 recording, 5 captures, then a pause and one capture the pause refuses.
 What codex-vm saves is decided by this test's .vmargs alone.

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console, Device.Port] Nothing = act
    c1 <- sr-capture (sr-tick (sr-tick (sr-tick (sr-start screen-recorder-new))))
    c2 <- sr-capture c1
    c3 <- sr-capture c2
    c4 <- sr-capture c3
    c5 <- sr-capture c4
    st <- sr-capture (sr-pause c5)
    n <- sr-frames-saved
    print-line-uni (sr-status-label st & ": requested " & show (st.sr-frame-count) & ", saved " & show n)
  end